{"1661810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Abi and the soul", "steam_appid": 1661810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661810/extras/43cf987d22e56b7184eb3eec4b0eaf33.poster.avif?t=1638465934\" width=598 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661810/extras/43cf987d22e56b7184eb3eec4b0eaf33.webm?t=1638465934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661810/extras/43cf987d22e56b7184eb3eec4b0eaf33.mp4?t=1638465934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Abi wakes up without memory on a somewhat strange island, perhaps somewhat magical, where thanks to the help of a celestial light, she will be able to overcome various puzzles and reach places never thought of.<br><br>Undoubtedly a story of love and fantastic friendship where you will have to discover the mystery of the place and recover all your memories by finding small fragments scattered throughout the island.</strong><br><br><strong>Play with the two characters.</strong><br><br><strong>When you play with <u>&quot;soul&quot;</u> you can move freely around the place, to anticipate dangers, activate magical mechanisms and help Abi in various situations.<br><br>When you play as <u>&quot;Abi&quot;</u> soul will follow you to protect you and guide yourself in any circumstance. When she moves away from you you can call her with a hiss and she will immediately fly to your side.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>For fans of Journey, Firewatch and Shelter.<br></li><li>An emotional and intimate story by a one-man team with an unforgettable ending.<br></li><li>Use two characters with completely different mechanics to overcome puzzles.<br></li><li>Enjoy the incredible soundtrack.<br></li><li>A short game (about an hour and a half), focused on the story, with a bit of light puzzle solving and platforming.</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661810/extras/43cf987d22e56b7184eb3eec4b0eaf33.poster.avif?t=1638465934\" width=598 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661810/extras/43cf987d22e56b7184eb3eec4b0eaf33.webm?t=1638465934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661810/extras/43cf987d22e56b7184eb3eec4b0eaf33.mp4?t=1638465934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Abi wakes up without memory on a somewhat strange island, perhaps somewhat magical, where thanks to the help of a celestial light, she will be able to overcome various puzzles and reach places never thought of.<br><br>Undoubtedly a story of love and fantastic friendship where you will have to discover the mystery of the place and recover all your memories by finding small fragments scattered throughout the island.</strong><br><br><strong>Play with the two characters.</strong><br><br><strong>When you play with <u>&quot;soul&quot;</u> you can move freely around the place, to anticipate dangers, activate magical mechanisms and help Abi in various situations.<br><br>When you play as <u>&quot;Abi&quot;</u> soul will follow you to protect you and guide yourself in any circumstance. When she moves away from you you can call her with a hiss and she will immediately fly to your side.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>For fans of Journey, Firewatch and Shelter.<br></li><li>An emotional and intimate story by a one-man team with an unforgettable ending.<br></li><li>Use two characters with completely different mechanics t